<%- include('../layouts/header') %>

<nav class="mb-5 flex items-center gap-2 text-xs font-medium text-slate-400 dark:text-slate-500" aria-label="Navegação estrutural">
    <a href="<%= url('/denuncias') %>" class="transition hover:text-blue-600 dark:hover:text-blue-400">As minhas denúncias</a>
    <svg class="h-3 w-3" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" aria-hidden="true"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M8.25 4.5l7.5 7.5-7.5 7.5"/></svg>
    <span class="text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-200">Nova denúncia</span>
</nav>

<div class="mb-6 flex flex-col gap-2 sm:flex-row sm:items-end sm:justify-between">
    <div>
        <span class="ca-eyebrow">Registo de ocorrência</span>
        <h1 class="ca-page-title mt-1">Nova denúncia</h1>
        <p class="ca-muted mt-1">Descreve o problema, confirma o local e anexa uma fotografia. Leva menos de dois minutos.</p>
    </div>
    <span class="ca-chip self-start sm:self-auto">
        <svg class="h-3.5 w-3.5 text-emerald-500" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" aria-hidden="true"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9 12.75L11.25 15 15 9.75M21 12a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"/></svg>
        Dados protegidos
    </span>
</div>

<div class="mb-6 flex items-start gap-3 rounded-2xl border border-rose-200 bg-rose-50 p-4 text-rose-800 dark:border-rose-900 dark:bg-rose-950/40 dark:text-rose-200">
    <span class="flex h-8 w-8 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-rose-600 text-white">
        <svg class="h-4 w-4" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" aria-hidden="true"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M12 9v3.75m0 3.75h.008v.008H12v-.008zM10.29 3.86L1.82 18a2.25 2.25 0 001.95 3.38h16.46a2.25 2.25 0 001.95-3.38L13.71 3.86a2.25 2.25 0 00-3.42 0z"/></svg>
    </span>
    <div class="text-xs leading-relaxed sm:text-sm">
        <strong class="block font-bold">Emergência ou perigo de vida iminente?</strong>
        Esta plataforma é para manutenção urbana. Em caso de cabos elétricos caídos em chamas, feridos graves ou risco de desabamento, liga de imediato <strong>198 (Bombeiros)</strong> ou <strong>112 (Polícia)</strong>.
    </div>
</div>

<div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-6 lg:grid-cols-[minmax(0,1fr)_20rem]">
    <form method="POST" action="<%= url('/denuncias') %>" enctype="multipart/form-data" class="space-y-5">
        <input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<%= csrfToken %>">

        <!-- Passo 1 -->
        <section class="ca-card ca-card-pad">
            <div class="mb-4 flex items-center gap-3 border-b border-slate-100 pb-3 dark:border-slate-800">
                <span class="flex h-7 w-7 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-blue-600 text-xs font-bold text-white">1</span>
                <div>
                    <h2 class="font-display text-base font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">Fotografia da ocorrência</h2>
                    <p class="text-[11px] text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400">JPG, PNG ou WebP · máximo 5 MB</p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="rounded-2xl border-2 border-dashed border-slate-200 bg-slate-50/70 p-5 transition hover:border-blue-300 hover:bg-blue-50/40 dark:border-slate-700 dark:bg-slate-900/40 dark:hover:border-blue-700">
                <input type="file" name="photo" id="photo" accept="image/jpeg,image/png,image/webp" capture="environment" required
                       class="block w-full cursor-pointer text-sm text-slate-600 file:mr-4 file:rounded-xl file:border-0 file:bg-blue-600 file:px-4 file:py-2.5 file:text-sm file:font-semibold file:text-white hover:file:bg-blue-700 dark:text-slate-300 dark:file:bg-blue-600">
                <p class="mt-2 text-[11px] leading-relaxed text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400">
                    Tira uma fotografia clara do problema. A IA pode sugerir a categoria automaticamente, mas a decisão final é sempre tua.
                </p>

                <img id="photo-preview" alt="Pré-visualização da fotografia" class="mt-4 hidden h-40 w-56 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 object-cover shadow-sm dark:border-slate-700">

                <p id="photo-analyzing" class="mt-3 hidden flex items-center gap-2 text-xs font-semibold text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400">
                    <span class="h-3 w-3 animate-spin rounded-full border-2 border-blue-500 border-t-transparent"></span>
                    A IA está a analisar a fotografia…
                </p>
                <p id="photo-ai-note" class="mt-3 hidden rounded-xl border border-blue-200 bg-blue-50 p-3 text-xs font-medium leading-relaxed text-blue-800 dark:border-blue-900 dark:bg-blue-950/40 dark:text-blue-200"></p>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- Passo 2 -->
        <section class="ca-card ca-card-pad">
            <div class="mb-4 flex items-center gap-3 border-b border-slate-100 pb-3 dark:border-slate-800">
                <span class="flex h-7 w-7 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-blue-600 text-xs font-bold text-white">2</span>
                <div>
                    <h2 class="font-display text-base font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">Detalhes do problema</h2>
                    <p class="text-[11px] text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400">Quanto mais contexto, mais rápida é a triagem.</p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="space-y-4">
                <div>
                    <label for="category_id" class="ca-label">Categoria <span class="text-rose-500">*</span></label>
                    <select name="id_categoria" id="category_id" required class="ca-input">
                        <option value="">Escolhe a categoria</option>
                        <% categories.forEach(function(category) { %>
                            <option value="<%= category.id %>" <%= String(old.id_categoria) === String(category.id) ? 'selected' : '' %>>
                                <%= category.name %>
                            </option>
                        <% }) %>
                    </select>
                </div>

                <div>
                    <div class="mb-1.5 flex items-center justify-between">
                        <label for="description" class="ca-label mb-0">Descrição <span class="text-rose-500">*</span></label>
                        <span class="text-[11px] text-slate-400 dark:text-slate-500">Mínimo 10 caracteres</span>
                    </div>
                    <textarea name="descricao" id="description" rows="4" required minlength="10"
                              placeholder="Explica o que está a acontecer, pontos de referência e se há perigo…"
                              class="ca-input resize-y"><%= old.descricao || '' %></textarea>

                    <button type="button" id="ai-suggestion"
                            class="mt-2 hidden w-full rounded-xl border border-violet-200 bg-violet-50 p-3 text-left text-xs font-medium leading-relaxed text-violet-800 transition hover:bg-violet-100 dark:border-violet-800 dark:bg-violet-950/40 dark:text-violet-200 dark:hover:bg-violet-950/60"></button>
                </div>

                <div id="duplicate-warning" class="hidden rounded-2xl border border-amber-200 bg-amber-50/80 p-4 dark:border-amber-800 dark:bg-amber-950/30">
                    <div class="mb-2 flex items-center gap-2 text-xs font-bold text-amber-800 dark:text-amber-200">
                        <svg class="h-4 w-4" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" aria-hidden="true"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M12 18v-5.25m0 0a2.25 2.25 0 100-4.5 2.25 2.25 0 000 4.5zm0 0h-.008M21 12a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"/></svg>
                        Encontrámos ocorrências parecidas perto deste local
                    </div>
                    <div id="duplicate-list" class="space-y-2"></div>
                    <p class="mt-2 text-[11px] leading-relaxed text-amber-700 dark:text-amber-300">
                        Se for o mesmo problema, confirma a ocorrência existente. Se for diferente, continua e envia a tua denúncia.
                    </p>
                </div>

                <div>
                    <label for="neighborhood" class="ca-label">Bairro ou ponto de referência <span class="font-normal text-slate-400">(opcional)</span></label>
                    <input type="text" name="bairro" id="neighborhood" value="<%= old.bairro || '' %>" maxlength="120"
                           placeholder="Ex.: Polana Cimento, perto do mercado…" class="ca-input">
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- Passo 3 -->
        <section class="ca-card ca-card-pad">
            <div class="mb-4 flex items-center gap-3 border-b border-slate-100 pb-3 dark:border-slate-800">
                <span class="flex h-7 w-7 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-blue-600 text-xs font-bold text-white">3</span>
                <div>
                    <h2 class="font-display text-base font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">Localização no mapa</h2>
                    <p class="text-[11px] text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400">Clica no mapa ou arrasta o pino para o ponto exato.</p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div id="location-picker" class="h-[320px] w-full overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 shadow-inner dark:border-slate-700"></div>
            <p id="location-status" class="mt-2 flex items-center gap-2 text-xs text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400">
                <span class="h-2 w-2 animate-pulse rounded-full bg-blue-500"></span>
                A obter localização por GPS…
            </p>

            <input type="hidden" name="latitude" id="latitude" value="<%= old.latitude || '' %>" required>
            <input type="hidden" name="longitude" id="longitude" value="<%= old.longitude || '' %>" required>
        </section>

        <div class="flex flex-col items-center justify-between gap-4 sm:flex-row">
            <p class="text-center text-[11px] leading-relaxed text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 sm:text-left">
                Ao enviar, autorizas que a fotografia e as coordenadas sejam partilhadas com os serviços municipais.
            </p>
            <button type="submit" class="ca-btn-primary w-full shrink-0 sm:w-auto">
                <svg class="h-4 w-4" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" aria-hidden="true"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M6 12L3.269 3.126A59.768 59.768 0 0121.485 12 59.77 59.77 0 013.27 20.876L5.999 12zm0 0h7.5"/></svg>
                Enviar denúncia
            </button>
        </div>
    </form>

    <!-- Apoio -->
    <aside class="space-y-4">
        <section class="ca-card ca-card-pad">
            <h2 class="flex items-center gap-2 font-display text-sm font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">
                <span class="flex h-7 w-7 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-amber-100 text-sm dark:bg-amber-950/60" aria-hidden="true">💡</span>
                Dicas para uma boa denúncia
            </h2>
            <ul class="mt-3 space-y-3 text-xs leading-relaxed text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300">
                <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
                    <span class="mt-0.5 font-bold text-emerald-600 dark:text-emerald-400" aria-hidden="true">✓</span>
                    <span><strong class="font-semibold text-slate-800 dark:text-slate-100">Foto nítida:</strong> mostra o problema e um pouco da rua em volta.</span>
                </li>
                <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
                    <span class="mt-0.5 font-bold text-emerald-600 dark:text-emerald-400" aria-hidden="true">✓</span>
                    <span><strong class="font-semibold text-slate-800 dark:text-slate-100">Local preciso:</strong> ajusta o pino se o GPS tiver desvio.</span>
                </li>
                <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
                    <span class="mt-0.5 font-bold text-emerald-600 dark:text-emerald-400" aria-hidden="true">✓</span>
                    <span><strong class="font-semibold text-slate-800 dark:text-slate-100">Contexto:</strong> menciona referências como “em frente à farmácia”.</span>
                </li>
            </ul>
        </section>

        <section class="rounded-2xl border border-blue-200 bg-blue-50/80 p-5 text-xs text-blue-800 dark:border-blue-900 dark:bg-blue-950/40 dark:text-blue-200">
            <h2 class="flex items-center gap-2 text-sm font-bold">
                <svg class="h-4 w-4" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" aria-hidden="true"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9 12.75L11.25 15 15 9.75m-3-7.036A11.959 11.959 0 013.598 6 11.99 11.99 0 003 9.749c0 5.592 3.824 10.29 9 11.622 5.176-1.332 9-6.03 9-11.622 0-1.31-.21-2.571-.598-3.751h-.152c-3.196 0-6.1-1.248-8.25-3.285z"/></svg>
                Privacidade
            </h2>
            <p class="mt-2 leading-relaxed">
                O teu email e a palavra-passe nunca aparecem no mapa público. Apenas a fotografia, a descrição e as coordenadas são visíveis para os serviços municipais.
            </p>
        </section>

        <section class="ca-card p-5">
            <h2 class="text-xs font-bold text-slate-800 dark:text-slate-100">Precisas de ajuda?</h2>
            <p class="mt-1.5 text-[11px] leading-relaxed text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400">
                O assistente virtual explica o fluxo, os estados e os prazos possíveis.
            </p>
            <button type="button" data-chatbot-open class="ca-btn-secondary mt-3 w-full text-xs">
                Abrir assistente virtual
            </button>
        </section>
    </aside>
</div>

<script src="<%= url('vendor/leaflet/leaflet.js') %>" defer></script>
<script src="<%= url('js/report-form.js') %>" defer></script>

<%- include('../layouts/footer') %>
